psion/opl #1104, from cporteous, 386 chars, Apr 18 00:11 94
Comment to 1102. 
----------
If you have version 1 of the programming manual, the text of the
description of FINDFIELD() is wrong. It is the case
dependant/independant value that should be multiplied by 16 before
being added to the direction value.

Also there is a bug associated with this function.

You should POKEB(PEEKW($1c)+7),0 immediately before any call to
FINDFIELD() to avoid the problem.

Regards Colin

